msgid "Which one to install"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/snap-and-deb-packages.md:147
msgid ""
"If an app is available both as a snap and a deb, we generally recommend "
"installing the snap version, especially if the app comes from a third-party "
"developer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../explanation/snap-and-deb-packages.md:149
msgid ""
"The snap usually provides a more recent version of the app and ensures "
"stronger security."
msgstr ""
